  <div class="policy-orb policy-orb-one"></div>
  <div class="policy-orb policy-orb-two"></div>

  <div class="policy-container policy-hero-content">

    <span class="policy-badge">
      <i class="fas fa-shield-halved"></i>
      Admission Information
    </span>

    <h1>Guidelines <span>&amp;</span> Policies</h1>

    <p>
      Everything parents and students should know before beginning
      the admission journey at Gyan Jyoti English Medium School.
    </p>

    <div class="policy-breadcrumb">
      <a href="/"><i class="fas fa-house"></i> Home</a>
      <i class="fas fa-chevron-right"></i>
      <span>Guidelines &amp; Policies</span>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<section class="policy-intro-section">
  <div class="policy-container">

    <div class="policy-intro">

      <div class="intro-icon">
        <i class="fas fa-clipboard-check"></i>
      </div>

      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">Admission Guidelines</span>
        <h2>A smooth admission process starts with the right information.</h2>
        <p>
          Please read the following important guidelines carefully before
          applying. These points provide a clear overview of documents,
          eligibility, interaction, fees and school expectations.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<section class="guidelines-section">
  <div class="policy-container">

    <div class="section-heading">
      <span class="section-number">01 — GUIDELINES</span>
      <h2>Important Information</h2>
      <p>
        Keep these six key points in mind while planning your child's admission.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="guidelines-grid">

      <article class="guideline-card">
        <div class="card-top">
          <div class="guideline-icon">
            <i class="fas fa-folder-open"></i>
          </div>
          <span class="card-number">01</span>
        </div>

        <span class="card-label">DOCUMENTATION</span>
        <h3>Required Documents</h3>

        <p>
          Birth certificate, previous school report card, transfer certificate,
          Aadhaar card and passport size photographs may be required.
        </p>

        <div class="card-line"></div>
        <span class="card-footer">
          <i class="fas fa-file-circle-check"></i>
          Keep documents ready
        </span>
      </article>

      <article class="guideline-card">
        <div class="card-top">
          <div class="guideline-icon">
            <i class="fas fa-calendar-days"></i>
          </div>
          <span class="card-number">02</span>
        </div>

        <span class="card-label">ELIGIBILITY</span>
        <h3>Age Criteria</h3>

        <p>
          Admission is granted according to age eligibility and class
          standards as per school norms.
        </p>

        <div class="card-line"></div>
        <span class="card-footer">
          <i class="fas fa-user-check"></i>
          Check class eligibility
        </span>
      </article>

      <article class="guideline-card">
        <div class="card-top">
          <div class="guideline-icon">
            <i class="fas fa-comments"></i>
          </div>
          <span class="card-number">03</span>
        </div>

        <span class="card-label">ASSESSMENT</span>
        <h3>Interaction</h3>

        <p>
          Student interaction or assessment may be conducted depending
          on the class applied for.
        </p>

        <div class="card-line"></div>
        <span class="card-footer">
          <i class="fas fa-people-arrows"></i>
          Student interaction
        </span>
      </article>

      <article class="guideline-card featured-policy">
        <div class="card-top">
          <div class="guideline-icon">
            <i class="fas fa-receipt"></i>
          </div>
          <span class="card-number">04</span>
        </div>

        <span class="card-label">CONFIRMATION</span>
        <h3>Fee Submission</h3>

        <p>
          Admission will be confirmed only after successful document
          verification and fee payment.
        </p>

        <div class="card-line"></div>
        <span class="card-footer">
          <i class="fas fa-circle-check"></i>
          Complete confirmation
        </span>
      </article>

      <article class="guideline-card">
        <div class="card-top">
          <div class="guideline-icon">
            <i class="fas fa-scale-balanced"></i>
          </div>
          <span class="card-number">05</span>
        </div>

        <span class="card-label">STUDENT LIFE</span>
        <h3>Discipline Policy</h3>

        <p>
          Students are expected to follow school discipline, uniform
          rules and code of conduct.
        </p>

        <div class="card-line"></div>
        <span class="card-footer">
          <i class="fas fa-star"></i>
          Respect school values
        </span>
      </article>

      <article class="guideline-card">
        <div class="card-top">
          <div class="guideline-icon">
            <i class="fas fa-gavel"></i>
          </div>
          <span class="card-number">06</span>
        </div>

        <span class="card-label">ADMISSION</span>
        <h3>Final Decision</h3>

        <p>
          The school admission committee reserves the final decision
          regarding admission approval.
        </p>

        <div class="card-line"></div>
        <span class="card-footer">
          <i class="fas fa-shield-check"></i>
          Committee decision
        </span>
      </article>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<section class="policy-process-section">
  <div class="policy-container">

    <div class="process-heading">
      <span class="section-number">02 — QUICK CHECK</span>
      <h2>Before You Apply</h2>
      <p>
